{"id":"god-wall-god-trick","nome_en":"God Wall, God Trick","nome_jp":"神の裏技 ゴッド・ウォール","nome_it":"","civilta":["Zero"],"costo":5,"potere":null,"potere_num":null,"tipo":"Spell","razze":[],"testo":"Gravity Zero\n■ Choose one of your creatures in the battle zone. If it's a God, until the start of your next turn, when that creature would leave the battle zone, it stays in the battle zone instead. If it's not a God, until the start of your next turn, when that creature would be destroyed, it stays in the battle zone instead.","testo_jp":"■ G・ゼロ―バトルゾーンに自分のゴッドがあれば、この呪文をコストを支払わずに唱えてもよい。\n■ バトルゾーンにある自分のクリーチャーを1体選ぶ。それがゴッドれあれば、自分の次のターンのはじめまで、そのクリーチャーがバトルゾーンを離れる時、離れるかわりにとどまる。ゴッドでなければ、次の自分のターンの初めまで、そのクリーチャーが破壊される時、墓地に置かれるかわりにバトルゾーンにとどまる。","mana":null,"set_code":"DMR-10","set_nome":"Dead & Beat","rarita":"Uncommon","numero":"20/55, 20m/55","formato":"OCG","illustratori":["kawasumi","Norikatsu Miyoshi"],"url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/d/da/Dmr10-20.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200129132341","url_wiki":"https://duelmasters.fandom.com/wiki/God_Wall,_God_Trick","varianti":[{"set_code":"DMR-10","set_nome":"Dead & Beat","numero":"20/55","rarita":"Uncommon","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/d/da/Dmr10-20.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200129132341"},{"set_code":"DMR-10","set_nome":"Dead & Beat","numero":"20m/55\n (Mode Change Card)","rarita":"Uncommon","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/f/f0/Dmr10-20m.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130920143146"},{"set_code":"DM22-RP2","set_nome":"Dragon Emperor of Booming Flame","numero":"TF14/TF20","rarita":"Uncommon","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelmasters/images/4/45/Dm22rp2-tf14.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20221216130916"},{"set_code":"DM22-RP2","set_nome":"Dragon Emperor of Booming Flame","numero":"T14/T20","rarita":"Uncommon","formato":"OCG","url_immagine":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/duelm